{"ref":"BDB, שְׂבָכָה","hw":"שְׂבָכָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂבָכָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. lattice-work, network</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.18\">1 K 7:18</a> +, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂבָכוֹת</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.41\">41</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂבָכִים</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.17\">17</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  prob. window-<em>lattice</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 1:2\" href=\"/II_Kings.1.2\">2 K 1:2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  net-ornament on pillars, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.17\">1 K 7:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (om. 𝔊 Kit Benz), v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.20\">20</a> (crpt., (cf. Kit Benz), v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.41\">41</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:42\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.42\">42</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.12\">2 Ch 4:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.13\">13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 25:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.25.17\">2 K 25:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.22\">Je 52:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.23\">23</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>network, toils</em>, for catching animals (fig.) <a data-ref=\"Job 18:8\" href=\"/Job.18.8\">Jb 18:8</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶשֶׁת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּח</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צַמִּים</span>).","next":"BDB, שְׂבָכִים","prev":"BDB, שׂוֹבֶךְ"}